//! The Cantor basis of the tower: `v_0 = 1` and `v_i² + v_i = v_{i−1}`, taking the root
//! whose lowest bit is clear.
//!
//! `v_0, …, v_{2^k−1}` is an `F_2`-basis of `GF(2^(2^k))`, so the first `2^ℓ` vectors span the
//! additive NTT domain `S_ℓ` and the domain a level sees is the domain every wider level sees.

